Table full name: bigquery-public-data.new_york.tree_census_2015
Column name: tree_id Type: INT64 Description: Unique identification number for each tree point
Column name: block_id Type: INT64 Description: Identifier linking each tree to the block in the blockface table/shapefile that it is mapped on.
Column name: created_at Type: DATE Description: The date tree points were collected in the census software
Column name: tree_dbh Type: INT64 Description: Diameter of the tree, measured at approximately 54" / 137cm above the ground.
Column name: stump_diam Type: INT64 Description: Diameter of stump measured through the center, rounded to the nearest inch.
Column name: curb_loc Type: STRING Description: Location of tree bed in relationship to the curb; trees are either along the curb (OnCurb) or offset from the curb (OffsetFromCurb)
Column name: status Type: STRING Description: Indicates whether the tree is alive, standing dead, or a stump.
Column name: health Type: STRING Description: Indicates the user's perception of tree health.
Column name: spc_latin Type: STRING Description: Scientific name for species, e.g. "Acer rubrum"
Column name: spc_common Type: STRING Description: Common name for species, e.g. "red maple"
Column name: steward Type: STRING Description: Indicates the number of unique signs of stewardship observed for this tree. Not recorded for stumps or dead trees.
Column name: guards Type: STRING Description: Indicates whether a guard is present, and if the user felt it was a helpful or harmful guard. Not recorded for dead trees and stumps
Column name: sidewalk Type: STRING Description: Indicates whether one of the sidewalk flags immediately adjacent to the tree was damaged, cracked, or lifted. Not recorded for dead trees and stumps.
Column name: user_type Type: STRING Description: This field describes the category of user who collected this tree point's data.
Column name: problems Type: STRING
Column name: root_stone Type: STRING Description: Indicates the presence of a root problem caused by paving stones in tree bed
Column name: root_grate Type: STRING Description: Indicates the presence of a root problem caused by metal grates in tree bed
Column name: root_other Type: STRING Description: Indicates the presence of other root problems
Column name: trunk_wire Type: STRING Description: Indicates the presence of a trunk problem caused by wires or rope wrapped around the trunk
Column name: trnk_light Type: STRING Description: Indicates the presence of a trunk problem caused by lighting installed on the tree
Column name: trnk_other Type: STRING Description: Indicates the presence of other trunk problems
Column name: brch_light Type: STRING Description: Indicates the presence of a branch problem caused by lights (usually string lights) or wires in the branches
Column name: brch_shoe Type: STRING Description: Indicates the presence of a branch problem caused by sneakers in the branches
Column name: brch_other Type: STRING Description: Indicates the presence of other branch problems
Column name: address Type: STRING Description: Nearest estimated address to tree
Column name: zipcode Type: INT64 Description: Five-digit zipcode in which tree is located
Column name: zip_city Type: STRING Description: City as derived from zipcode. This is often (but not always) the same as borough.
Column name: cb_num Type: INT64 Description: Community board in which tree point is located
Column name: borocode Type: INT64 Description: Code for borough in which tree point is located
Column name: boroname Type: STRING Description: Name of borough in which tree point is located
Column name: cncldist Type: INT64 Description: Council district in which tree point is located
Column name: st_assem Type: INT64 Description: State Assembly District in which tree point is located
Column name: st_senate Type: INT64 Description: State Senate District in which tree point is located
Column name: nta Type: STRING Description: This is the NTA Code corresponding to the neighborhood tabulation area from the 2010 US Census that the tree point falls into.
Column name: nta_name Type: STRING Description: This is the NTA name corresponding to the neighborhood tabulation area from the 2010 US Census that the tree point falls into.
Column name: boro_ct Type: INT64 Description: This is the boro_ct identifyer for the census tract that the tree point falls into.
Column name: state Type: STRING Description: All features given value 'New York'
Column name: latitude Type: FLOAT64 Description: Latitude of point, in decimal degrees
Column name: longitude Type: FLOAT64 Description: Longitude of point, in decimal degrees
Column name: x_sp Type: FLOAT64 Description: X coordinate, in state plane. Units are feet.
Column name: y_sp Type: FLOAT64 Description: Y coordinate, in state plane. Units are feet
Sample rows:
[{'tree_id': 242259, 'block_id': 111782, 'created_at': '2015-09-20', 'tree_dbh': 5, 'stump_diam': 0, 'curb_loc': 'OffsetFromCurb', 'status': 'Dead', 'health': '', 'spc_latin': '', 'spc_common': '', 'steward': '', 'guards': '', 'sidewalk': '', 'user_type': 'Volunteer', 'problems': '', 'root_stone': 'No', 'root_grate': 'No', 'root_other': 'No', 'trunk_wire': 'No', 'trnk_light': 'No', 'trnk_other': 'No', 'brch_light': 'No', 'brch_shoe': 'No', 'brch_other': 'No', 'address': '991 5 AVENUE', 'zipcode': 83, 'zip_city': 'Central Park', 'cb_num': 108, 'borocode': 1, 'boroname': 'Manhattan', 'cncldist': 6, 'st_assem': 69, 'st_senate': 29, 'nta': 'MN40', 'nta_name': 'Upper East Side-Carnegie Hill', 'boro_ct': 1014300, 'state': 'New York', 'latitude': 40.77784648, 'longitude': -73.96324124, 'x_sp': 994430.5974, 'y_sp': 222669.4113}, {'tree_id': 407391, 'block_id': 111770, 'created_at': '2015-10-31', 'tree_dbh': 4, 'stump_diam': 0, 'curb_loc': 'OffsetFromCurb', 'status': 'Dead', 'health': '', 'spc_latin': '', 'spc_common': '', 'steward': '', 'guards': '', 'sidewalk': '', 'user_type': 'Volunteer', 'problems': '', 'root_stone': 'No', 'root_grate': 'No', 'root_other': 'No', 'trunk_wire': 'No', 'trnk_light': 'No', 'trnk_other': 'No', 'brch_light': 'No', 'brch_shoe': 'No', 'brch_other': 'No', 'address': '871 5 AVENUE', 'zipcode': 83, 'zip_city': 'Central Park', 'cb_num': 108, 'borocode': 1, 'boroname': 'Manhattan', 'cncldist': 6, 'st_assem': 75, 'st_senate': 29, 'nta': 'MN40', 'nta_name': 'Upper East Side-Carnegie Hill', 'boro_ct': 1014300, 'state': 'New York', 'latitude': 40.77009288, 'longitude': -73.96890291, 'x_sp': 992863.5612, 'y_sp': 219843.9081}, {'tree_id': 216053, 'block_id': 304155, 'created_at': '2015-09-11', 'tree_dbh': 8, 'stump_diam': 0, 'curb_loc': 'OnCurb', 'status': 'Dead', 'health': '', 'spc_latin': '', 'spc_common': '', 'steward': '', 'guards': '', 'sidewalk': '', 'user_type': 'Volunteer', 'problems': '', 'root_stone': 'No', 'root_grate': 'No', 'root_other': 'No',